# On empty core the scan never finds a target: an empty cell costs ADD and JMZ, which jumps straight
# back to the ADD, so after three instructions p has grown by 10 twice. p lives in the B-field of
# the repeat's own JMP (cell 3), as in the hand-written scanner's layout.
golden: bbctests/archetypes/scanner.bbc
cell 3 3 JMP.B $-3, #40
alive 1000
